\item If both intensities are zero throughout \code{h_range}, both point processes are empty, all divergences are 0, and the shape terms are \code{NA}.
\item \code{kl_sym} is \code{Inf} if either direction is \code{Inf}, i.e. whenever exactly one of the intensities is zero on part of \code{h_range}.
